(Perhaps some apology is required for the occasional use of) Tj T*
(plain-spoken, not to say coarse words. I can only urge, in) Tj T*
(justification of their adoption, that the nature of the subject would) Tj T*
(not admit of their being softened,?unless indeed at the expense of the) Tj T*
(narrative. As it is, I have sent forth this edition in very much more) Tj T*
