(The v^{th} chapter is about DOBISSERS. These beggars \(STIRNENSTÖSSER,) Tj T*
(_i.e._ spurious anointers\) go _HOSTIATIM_ from house to house, and) Tj T*
(touch the peasant and his wife \(HANZ und HANZIN\) with the Holy Virgin,) Tj T*
