(Beware, likewise, of the doctors who travel up and down the country,) Tj T*
(and offer theriack and roots, and make much ado about themselves, and) Tj T*
(especially some blind doctors. One called Hans of Strasburg, has been a) Tj T*
(Jew, and was christened at Strasburg at Whitsuntide; years ago his eyes) Tj T*
(were bored out at Worms, but he is now a physician, and tells fortunes,) Tj T*
(and travels from place to place, and cheats and defrauds every body.) Tj T*
(How? I need not say, I could tell well enough.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(_Item_, beware of the JONERS \(gamblers\) who practice BESEFLERY with the) Tj T*
(BRIEF \(cheating at cards\), who _deal_ falsely and _cut_ one for the) Tj T*
(other, cheat with BÖGLEIN and SPIES, pick one BRIEF \(card\) from the) Tj T*
